The suite failed, so the status is FINDINGS. `tests/verify.sh` exited 1 because `I3.turn-left` failed with `shift=-116px`. That is the only failing check. Everything else in the playtest passed apart from three checks marked UNVERIFIED (no way to check them yet).

- **Run:** the unchanged `tests/verify.sh` ran against commit `e500c44` plus the uncommitted changes. The tooling check, selftest and clean build passed.
